  "changes_data": [
    {
      "diff": "@@ -20,19 +20,20 @@ If you or your organization would like to contribute or become a sponsor, please\n \n === Bug Fixes\n \n-If you are upgrading Wireshark 4.2.0 or 4.2.1 on Windows you will need to https://www.wireshark.org/download.html[download and install] Wireshark {wireshark-version} or later by hand.\n+// If you are upgrading Wireshark 4.2.0 or 4.2.1 on Windows you will need to https://www.wireshark.org/download.html[download and install] Wireshark {wireshark-version} or later by hand.\n \n The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2024-11[]\n-// Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n-// wsbuglink:xxx[].\n+* wssalink:2024-11[]\n+NTLMSSP dissector crash.\n+wsbuglink:19943[].\n // cveidlink:2024-xxx[].\n-// Fixed in master: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.2: xxx\n-// Fixed in release-4.0: xxx\n+// Fixed in master: 66dcd56f1e\n+// Fixed in release-4.2: be0e7c955d\n+// Fixed in release-4.0: ce871c20cd\n // CVSS AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H\n-// CWE-824\n+// CWE-825\n+// * OSS-Fuzz 70582: wireshark:fuzzshark_udp_port-dns: Stack-buffer-overflow in header_equal. wsbuglink:19943[].\n \n The following bugs have been fixed:\n \n@@ -41,6 +42,14 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark grabs your ID at 3 am, goes to Waffle House, and insults people.\n \n+* Fuzz job issue: fuzz-2024-01-31-7745.pcap. wsbuglink:19627[].\n+* OSS-Fuzz 70534: wireshark:fuzzshark_ip_proto-udp: Stack-overflow in dissect_cbor_main_type. wsbuglink:19935[].\n+* SOME/IP Protocol heuristic dissector fails to parse. wsbuglink:19670[].\n+* 6loWPAN: Page Number Field Incorrect Registration. wsbuglink:19934[].\n+// * null. wsbuglink:19955[].\n+* PacketBB incorrectly reports \"Malformed Packet\" wsbuglink:19972[].\n+// * null. wsbuglink:19986[].\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n",
